    <region top="4329" color="#000000">
      <area collapsed="true">
        <title lang="eng">
          <content>
            <p>Visualisation Construct</p>
          </content>
        </title>
      </area>
      <region left="9" top="4356" width="598" height="56" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
        <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
          <content>
            <p style="font-family: DejaVu Sans;">Evaluates the net accumulated air mass delivered to the receiver as a function of time:<br />  M_real(t) = (V_tank / R_air) * [ P_fit(t)/T_fit(t) - P_fit(0)/T_fit(0) ]  [kg]<br />  M_iso(t)  = (V_tank / (R_air * T_amb)) * [ P_fit(t) - P_fit(0) ]  [kg]</p>
          </content>
        </text>
      </region>
      <region left="18" top="4446" width="471" height="47" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
        <math decimalPlaces="4">
          <description active="true" position="Top" lang="eng">
